Key implementation details:
- Unlimited lives are represented by UNLIMITED_LIVES (-1) and handled specially in relevant methods
- Score calculation follows the exact formula provided in the requirements
- All methods are properly implemented with appropriate return values
- The class maintains all necessary state variables to track game progress

